EXPORTS

; Connecting to and disconnecting from TCM
tcmConnect
tcmDisconnect

; Handling of requests for resources
tcmRequestPermit
tcmActivatePermit
tcmIdlePermit
tcmDeactivatePermit
tcmReleasePermit
tcmGetPermitData

; Thread registration
tcmRegisterThread
tcmUnregisterThread

; Version information
tcmGetVersion
tcmGetVersionInfo
tcmRuntimeVersion
tcmRuntimeInterfaceVersion
